# uv
.uv/
# uv.lock is tracked on purpose: it pins the dependency graph the image
# and the CI builds against. It rotted once (the project version in it
# was two releases behind) precisely because nothing used it; the
# `uv lock --check` step in CI is what keeps it honest.

